      "SubmissionTime": "2025-11-25T12:46:07.000+00:00",
      "ReviewText": "I purchased this backpack blower and here is my review.  This thing blows leaves like a tornado.  I took it out of the box assembled it and gassed it up to give it a try.   It made a quick work of the leaves and spa sticks in my yard because it’s got plenty of power.   I wear hearing protection for the noise, but it doesn’t seem any louder than my old handheld gas blower. Only this one’s got a lot more wind coming out of the nozzle.  Compared to other brands, this one is a great value for the money.  I’m gonna make sure to winterize it properly, so hopefully it will last me for years.",
      "Title": "Great value for the money",
